}
semantic.evidence -> semantic.composition: Compose / select
cloud.discovery -> semantic.composition: Scoped observations
semantic.composition -> cloud.distribution: Admitted closure
cloud.identity -> runtime.adapter: Identity facts
cloud.distribution -> runtime.coordinator: Admitted publication
runtime.adapter -> runtime.coordinator: Exact operation
runtime.coordinator <-> semantic.source: Source guards
runtime.coordinator <-> runtime.authority: Evaluate / consume
runtime.coordinator <-> runtime.ledger: Fenced transactions
runtime.coordinator <-> runtime.broker: Claim / observations
runtime.broker -> upstream: One bound attempt
note: "POO defines governed effects across requests; the runtime preserves one-use state, history and budget.\nQuint / Lean links constrain the design. Each send needs current admission, a typed claim and the final broker gate." {
  class: note
  shape: text
  near: bottom-center
}

semantic.label.near: top-center
semantic.style.font-size: 18

cloud.label.near: top-center
cloud.style.font-size: 18

runtime.label.near: top-right
runtime.style.font-size: 18

